## Success Criteria

- [ ] Hook file created with 4 checkers
- [ ] Each checker reads correct timestamp file
- [ ] Detached spawn with lock file protection
- [ ] Fail-open (exit 0 always, try/catch everything)
- [ ] Log file captures all actions

## Risk Assessment

- **Risk:** Python venv not found → fail-open, log warning
- **Risk:** Lock file left stale → 10-min expiry auto-clears
- **Risk:** Multiple sessions start simultaneously → lock prevents double-spawn
